Subject: [PATCH v1 1/6] dt-bindings: i2c: qcom,i2c-cci: Add qcom,sc7180-cci

The SC7180 / SM7125 SoC has two CCI (Camera Control Interface) v2 blocks,
compatible with the msm8996-cci fallback. Add the SoC-specific compatible.

---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/qcom,i2c-cci.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/qcom,i2c-cci.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/qcom,i2c-cci.yaml
index 1e8def25ec0e..b71725761a99 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/qcom,i2c-cci.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/qcom,i2c-cci.yaml
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@ properties:
               - qcom,qcm2290-cci
               - qcom,qcs8300-cci
               - qcom,sa8775p-cci
+              - qcom,sc7180-cci
               - qcom,sc7280-cci
               - qcom,sc8280xp-cci
               - qcom,sdm670-cci
